# No line-ending conversion for any file: the converter maps and the test vectors are checked by SHA-256, and every
# file is stored exactly as it is meant to be checked out (LF, except where a file itself says otherwise).
# A clone with core.autocrlf=true therefore gets the same bytes as everyone else.
* -text
*.png binary
*.ico binary
